ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi031: OPEN_SHELL with one ADVANCED_FACE on a CONICAL_SURFACE (semi-angle 30°, axis +Z, apex at origin); FACE_OUTER_BOUND references an EDGE_LOOP containing: two degenerate ORIENTED_EDGEs (degen_A and degen_B) both at the apex — same zero-length EDGE_CURVEs with apex vertex at both ends — two lateral line edges from apex to base, and one base semi-circle arc; two degenerate apex EDGE_CURVEs in the same EDGE_LOOP IS the mechanism (Pro/E redundant apex bridge); EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND, ADVANCED_FACE, OPEN_SHELL; kernel must detect and dedupe to a single canonical apex bridge */
